&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you require a reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting@outschool.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting@outschool.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits packages are included for full-time employees only. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note benefits and perks may vary for employees based outside of the US and Canada.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Full-time employees must be a citizen or legal residents of the U.S. or Canada and reside in U.S. or Canada, unless specifically indicated otherwise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
